  "contractVersion": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Wire contract for a VMware Cloud Foundation 9.0 vCenter virtual-machine reconfiguration change set. Every operation, path, query parameter, property, status code and vocabulary below was extracted from the vSphere Automation API specification recorded in docs/official_sources.json. Do not edit: the loopback mock in internal/vcmock and the protected verifier in verify/ are both pinned to this file.",
